      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hi, I'm preparing for a first meeting with a new raw material supplier for our Munich plant. I need to draft a Master Service Agreement (MSA) to protect us from supply chain volatility. Can you provide a checklist of standard terms and conditions we should include to mitigate risks like price fluctuations and delivery delays?",
